.tpolecat/doobie-postgres_3/0.13.4/execution-metrics.json:48:      \"agent_guidance\": \"\",\n./stats/classworlds/classworlds/1.1/execution-metrics.json:58:      \"deterministic_setup\": [],\n./stats/classworlds/classworlds/1.1/execution-metrics.json:59:      \"agent_guidance\": \"Meaningful tests can exercise org.codehaus.classworlds.ClassWorld, ClassRealm, Configurator, and Launcher entirely in-process. If testing Launcher.main or mainWithExitCode, create a temporary classworlds.conf resource/file and set the classworlds.conf system property for that test, clearing it afterward; alternatively call Launcher.configure(InputStream) directly to avoid global system-property setup.\",\n./stats/io.opentelemetry.proto/opentelemetry-proto/1.10.0-alpha/execution-metrics.json:47:      \"deterministic_setup\": [],\n./stats/io.opentelemetry.proto/opentelemetry-proto/1.10.0-alpha/execution-metrics.json:48:      \"agent_guidance\": \"\",\n./stats/org.mockito/mockito-core/5.0.0/execution-metrics.json:53:      \"action\": \"advisory_preparation\",\n./stats/org.mockito/mockito-core/5.0.0/execution-metrics.json:58:      \"deterministic_setup\": [],\n./stats/org.mockito/mockito-core/5.0.0/execution-metrics.json:59:      \"agent_guidance\": \"Add or preserve `src/test/resources/mockito-extensions/org.mockito.plugins.MockMaker` with `mock-maker-proxy` or `org.mockito.internal.creation.proxy.ProxyMockMaker`. Write meaningful coverage around interface mocks, stubbing, verification, default answers, argument matchers/captors, and invocation inspection. Avoid relying on final-class, static, construction, or arbitrary class mocking unless local Native Image verification proves that path works.\",\n./stats/org.mockito/mockito-core/5.0.0/execution-metrics.json:150:      \"action\": \"advisory_preparation\",\n./stats/org.mockito/mockito-core/5.0.0/execution-metrics.json:151:      \"agent_guidance\": \"Add a test resource `src/test/resources/mockito-extensions/org.mockito.plugins.MockMaker` con