om.esotericsoftware.kryo.util.Util.isAndroid = true` to force Kryo's DefaultInstantiatorStrategy onto the reflection path instead of ReflectASM runtime class generation. Also call `kryo.setAsmEnabled(false)` for serializer instances. Use ordinary `Input`/`Output`, POJOs with accessible no-arg constructors, and concrete collections such as `new ArrayList<>(...)`; avoid making `Arrays.asList(...)` itself the deserialization target because Kryo 3 cannot instantiate `java.util.Arrays$ArrayList`.\",\n      \"risks\": [\n        \"The `kryo-shaded` artifact embeds shaded ReflectASM/ASM; if tests exercise the default ReflectASM path, native-image execution can fail with unsupported runtime class definition such as `*ConstructorAccess`.\",\n        \"Setting `Util.isAndroid = true` is a test workaround that avoids covering ReflectASM acceleration, but it enables meaningful coverage of Kryo serialization APIs under Native Image.\"\n      ],\n      \"applied_setup\": [],\n      \"input_evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"issue\",\n          \"summary\": \"#3033 Support for com.esotericsoftware:kryo-shaded:3.0.3; label=library-new-request; body_chars=107\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"existing_tests\",\n          \"summary\": \"0 existing test file path(s) included\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"model\": \"oca/gpt-5.5\",\n      \"input_tokens_used\": 41398,\n      \"output_tokens_used\": 6620,\n      \"prompt_path\": \"library-preflight-prompt.txt\",\n      \"raw_response_path\": \"library-preflight-response.txt\",\n      \"session_log_path\": \"/home/mihailo/git/graalvm-reachability-metadata-copy/forge/logs/com.esotericsoftware:kryo-shaded:3.0.3/library-preparation-preflight/pi-generation-2026-06-24T20-12-29-506164Z.log\"\n    },\n    \"metrics\": {\n      \"input_tokens_used\": 1331963,\n      \"cached_input_tokens_used\": 9942528,\n      \"output_tokens_used\": 106415,\n      \"iterations\": 24,\n      \"cost_usd\": 8.1638,\n      \"generated_l